00:00:30.690 --> 00:02:10.730
Happy Halloween!

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:13.040
We have some special coords for this All Hallows' Eve!

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:17.080
SoLaMi SMILE's members features all sorts of Halloween elements.

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:18.880
Monster Bat Coord!

00:02:19.320 --> 00:02:23.240
