00:02:23.240 --> 00:02:25.240
Monster Ghost Coord!

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:28.770
You look wonderful!

00:02:28.770 --> 00:02:31.460
It's time for the once-in-a-year Halloween event!

00:02:31.940 --> 00:02:33.920
Let's have a blast!

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:36.280
Yay...

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:38.420
Um...

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:42.030
I know we're bummed out that Phantom Thief Genius stole our coords,

00:02:42.030 --> 00:02:44.850
