00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:55.350
Besides, if we're sad, then that means the phantom gets what he wants.

00:02:55.350 --> 00:02:57.530
Yeah, he'd be happier than anyone!

00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:02.290
I don't like that.

00:03:02.290 --> 00:03:05.150
