00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:10.380
All right!

00:03:10.380 --> 00:03:12.490
Let's have a blast!

00:03:12.490 --> 00:03:12.910
Yep!

00:03:12.910 --> 00:03:14.580
You said it, Lala-pri!

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:16.500
Happy Halloween!

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:17.300
