00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:45.410
Ah.

00:03:45.690 --> 00:03:50.670
Those unique coords are another big trend from this year: local mascot dresses!

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:52.420
Local mascot dresses?

00:03:52.420 --> 00:03:53.080
I like it!

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:53.830
They take inspiration from specialty goods Japan over!

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:55.610
Looking good!

00:03:55.610 --> 00:03:55.970
They take inspiration from specialty goods Japan over!

00:03:55.970 --> 00:03:56.680
Amazing! Simply ravishing!

00:03:56.680 --> 00:03:58.980
They're really one of a kind!

00:03:58.980 --> 00:03:59.250
Very nice!

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:00.170
They're gorgeous! I want to wear one too!

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:01.700
Give us a smile!

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:01.950
They're gorgeous! I want to wear one too!

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:03.030
