00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:19.970
The costume contest will begin shortly!

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:21.990
Happy Halloween!

00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:26.030
Presiding over the contest will be these and the other mascots judges!

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:26.560
FRIGHTS!!

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:29.690
The person who gathers the most frights wins!

00:04:29.690 --> 00:04:30.990
FRIGHTS!!

00:04:30.990 --> 00:04:36.410
The winner will be bestowed a splendid crown and the title of "Miss Halloween"!

00:04:41.390 --> 00:04:42.900
Don your most wonderful costume...

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:45.640
Make my and the judges hearts...

00:04:46.420 --> 00:04:47.600
<i>tremble</i>.

00:04:48.310 --> 00:04:49.560
Make them... <i>tremble</i>.

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:52.520
Make them tremble!

00:04:56.850 --> 00:04:58.880
"Miss Halloween"...

00:04:58.880 --> 00:05:01.060
All fright, that's super duper cool!

00:05:01.060 --> 00:05:03.440
This sounds fun!

00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:05.910
It's Lala-tan!

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:09.280
