00:05:29.580 --> 00:05:32.640
I'm Ran-tan! Pleased to scare you!

00:05:32.640 --> 00:05:33.950
Pleased to scare you...

00:05:33.950 --> 00:05:37.020
But you're really a ghost, right, Ran-tan?

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:38.830
What's got your pri-tches in a knot?

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:40.550
Take a closer look-pri.

00:05:40.550 --> 00:05:43.070
She's got legs and everything-pri.

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:46.110
Mirei's fright! I'm a human!

