A human...

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:49.450
You're jumping at shadows!

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:54.030
You're predispositioned to expect something scary, so any stimulus provokes fright.

00:05:54.030 --> 00:05:55.830
Capisce...

00:05:56.360 --> 00:05:57.790
Deruderubii...

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:01.040
Deruderubii!

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:07.590
FRIGHTS

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:13.930
