00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:27.600
Perhaps, but an imitation serpent is all the more adorable!

00:06:27.600 --> 00:06:31.490
Volume 1031, chapter 66 of the prophetic grimoire Aroma:

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:34.410
take the form of the wicked and
become the harvest festival queen!

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:37.330
It means Aroma's gonna be Miss Halloween!

00:06:37.820 --> 00:06:39.390
How nice...

00:06:39.880 --> 00:06:42.880
That reminds me; Ran-tan, you loved horror so much...

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:46.110
that you went to train at its home, Horriwood, right?

00:06:46.110 --> 00:06:47.260
Oh, fright...

00:06:47.730 --> 00:06:51.760
What? You've been to the one and only Horriwood which I, too, yearned for?

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:58.130
Horriwood, crucible of all things horror, where kindred spirits gather! How I've longed to go!

00:06:58.530 --> 00:06:59.520
Wow!

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:01.710
