00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:22.680
And thus I can declare:

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:27.170
You're far from terrifying! Your paltry
fearsomeness is far outclassed by this!

00:07:28.530 --> 00:07:29.820
How perfectly peculiar!

00:07:29.820 --> 00:07:31.920
What on earth is that bizarre creature?

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:34.910
It's Neko-nee before she puts on her makeup!

00:07:34.910 --> 00:07:35.640
Scary!

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:38.660
Will you stop kitten around?

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:44.190
FRIGHTS

00:07:49.710 --> 00:07:51.780
Hm? Hey, where'd Ran-tan go?

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:54.690
