00:08:33.560 --> 00:08:34.910
Ran-tan...

00:08:35.260 --> 00:08:36.280
Like...

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:39.070
My rokurokubi's necks wound up in bow knots...

00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:43.850
My Yuki-onna winds up commenting on how warm it is...

00:08:43.850 --> 00:08:45.000
<i>It's not cold at all.</i>

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:50.000
Even when I dressed up as the classic villain from the 13th-generation Chainsaw Brothers,

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:53.510
I brandished a towel instead of a chainsaw!

00:08:54.520 --> 00:08:57.820
I'm pri amazed you can even get it that wrong...

00:08:58.380 --> 00:09:01.980
That's why I dropped out of Horriwood.

00:09:01.980 --> 00:09:05.010
I become the bottom rank-tan...

00:09:05.010 --> 00:09:06.880
So you went to study horror,

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:10.290
but you developed your skills in cute makeup instead-pri.

00:09:10.290 --> 00:09:12.120
That makes me feel down.

00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:13.650
I know!

00:09:14.020 --> 00:09:17.360
My mum says in times like this, you just need to believe in yourself.

00:09:18.840 --> 00:09:20.830
If you can only make yourself look cute,

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:22.920
