00:09:22.920 --> 00:09:24.130
Really?

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:25.420
Could you? Would you?

00:09:25.420 --> 00:09:28.380
I fear-y, fear-y wanna be Miss Halloween!

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:30.650
Let's all pitch in!

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:31.130
Pri!

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:31.690
Yes!

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:38.720
Oh no! Oh <i>no</i>!

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:39.530
He's coming!

00:09:39.530 --> 00:09:42.680
Ooh! I'm coming to suck your blood!

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:44.680
Oh no!

00:09:45.430 --> 00:09:48.600
I'm on my last legs. I can't run anymore-chanko!

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:53.060
He's going to plunge his fangs into my sweet, maidenly neck!

00:09:53.060 --> 00:09:54.160
Chanko-san.

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:55.070
Chanko?

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:57.990
