00:10:01.130 --> 00:10:02.830
Meganii-san...

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:04.890
You don't have to hold back, you know-chanko.

00:10:04.890 --> 00:10:06.690
Glasses flash!

00:10:06.690 --> 00:10:07.210
So bright!

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:09.670
He's running away-chanko!

00:10:15.020 --> 00:10:18.240
I'm still in a Dalí-mma over my Halloween costume!

00:10:18.240 --> 00:10:23.620
As an art teacher, I must produce a costume that brings wonder and inspiration-Da Vinci!

00:10:24.900 --> 00:10:27.600
My mind's a blank canvas...

00:10:35.410 --> 00:10:39.070
Ham-senpai, you've solved the Da Vinci code-Da Vinci!

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:41.780
Thank-ubrick!

00:10:42.540 --> 00:10:46.580
I'm decided and I'm ready to throw down Rodin!

00:11:02.290 --> 00:11:03.840
Devi!

00:11:03.840 --> 00:11:05.560
Meet my gaze and be turned to stone!

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:07.230
Stop-tori! I don't want to be stone!

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:09.760
Make sure you vote for Aroma plenty!

00:11:09.760 --> 00:11:10.630
Okay-tori!

00:11:11.490 --> 00:11:14.770
