00:12:27.250 --> 00:12:29.180
Fright, now I'm a mongoose!

00:12:29.180 --> 00:12:31.230
She's really cute-usa!

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:32.400
Curses!

00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:34.440
True, it's the natural foe of the pit viper,

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:37.940
