00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:03.210
It's fine!

00:13:03.210 --> 00:13:05.570
You all did your best to help me.

00:13:05.570 --> 00:13:08.760
I can't help what I look like, fright?

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:10.560
She's so cute!

00:13:12.910 --> 00:13:14.440
