00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:35.750
Dun-dun-Rodin!

00:13:37.320 --> 00:13:38.300
Da Vin...

00:13:38.300 --> 00:13:39.070
Da Vi–

00:13:40.030 --> 00:13:41.210
