00:14:17.490 --> 00:14:19.610
Now this is living art-kuma!

00:14:20.060 --> 00:14:22.250
Spam those frights-usa!

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:24.380
FRIGHTS

00:14:26.900 --> 00:14:28.180
