00:14:35.280 --> 00:14:37.540
I did it-Picasa-Da Vinci!

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:41.360
I'm Cézanne the title of Miss Halloween!

00:14:42.010 --> 00:14:44.260
Curses, again and again...

