00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:15.310
The costume event has now concluded!

00:15:18.530 --> 00:15:19.820
And so,

00:15:19.820 --> 00:15:22.770
Ran-tan has become Miss Halloween!

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:27.220
Congratulations, Ran-tan-pri!
Congratulations, Ran-tan!

00:15:28.370 --> 00:15:30.150
Thank you scary much!

00:15:31.220 --> 00:15:36.360
Thanks to all of you, I was able to become Miss Halloween! All fright!

00:15:36.360 --> 00:15:39.950
I want to thank you all! For this performance,

00:15:39.950 --> 00:15:42.460
will you let me do your makeup and styling?

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:44.550
Capisce!

00:15:44.550 --> 00:15:48.380
I'm sure your makeup sense will pri-pel us to greater heights of cuteness!

